grow_vertical = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Combat is turn-based and driven by your deck of cards

[b]Attack Cards[/b]: Deal damage to enemies based on your stats and modifiers.
[b]Block Cards[/b]: Add block to reduce incoming damage until your next turn.
[b]Skill Cards[/b]: Manipulate the battlefield, gain buffs, or debuff enemies.
[b]Movement Cards[/b]: Move across the map. Positioning is crucial for survival.
And more...

You can only play cards while you have energy, so plan your turn wisely."
fit_content = true

