bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Draw Phase: At the start of your turn, draw cards from your deck.

Play Phase: Use energy to play cards in any order.

End Turn: Unused block carries over only if specified.

[b]Periodically, the void will consume the outermost tiles of the map. This will destroy anything occupying consumed tiles.[/b]
"
